---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { SITE } from "../config";
---
<Base title="Privacy policy">
<div class="wrap page prose">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1><p class="callout">Draft — to be reviewed before launch.</p>
  <p>{SITE.name} is a static website. We do not require accounts and do not set advertising cookies.</p>
  <h2>What we collect</h2><ul><li>Privacy-friendly, cookie-less aggregate analytics (page views, referrers, country).</li><li>Information you send us when you submit a tool or buy a placement (name, email, tool details). Payments are processed by our merchant of record; we never see card numbers.</li></ul>
  <h2>How we use it</h2><p>To review submissions, deliver placements, and contact you about your listing. We don't sell personal data.</p>
  <h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>When you click an affiliate link, the destination site may set its own cookies under its own policy.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2><p>Ask us to access or delete your data at {SITE.contactEmail}.</p>
</div>
</Base>
